%% 3.2 Custom design order flow.
flowchart TD
    A[User] --> B["Design Apparel<br/>templates · text · sleeves · logo · 3D preview"]
    B --> C{Use AI Design<br/>Generator?}
    C -- Yes --> D["Gemini API<br/>creates artwork"]
    D --> B
    C -- No --> E[Save Design]
    E --> F["Order Summary<br/>price estimate · PWD/Senior 20%"]
    F --> G{Payment Method}
    G -- Pay Online --> H["PayMongo Checkout"]
    H --> I[Payment Verified]
    G -- COD --> J["Payment Uploaded<br/>(pay on delivery)"]
    J --> K[Admin Verifies]
    K --> I
    I --> L[Processing] --> M[Printing] --> N[Ready for Pickup] --> O[Delivered]
